 {
  "description": "You're outside the cottage of Miss Voss, the town librarian. The road turns north toward the village, and bends upward to the summit of Post Office Hill. As you approach the cottage you are greeted by the tiniest poodle you've ever seen in your entire life. It charges across the street, yapping angrily and showing its sharp little teeth. You can smell the poodle's hot breath as it yaps. What next?",
  "obj": 94,
  "objs": [
   94
  ],
  "title": "Outside Cottage"
 },
 {
  "description": "You're on a hilltop overlooking the seaside village of Festeron. To the south stands the Festeron Post Office. It's a little brick building with a neatly-trimmed lawn. The Post Office door stands invitingly open. Roads run down the hill to the east and west. There's a signpost nearby. Somebody inside the Post Office is calling you. What next?",
  "obj": 95,
  "objs": [
   95
  ],
  "title": "Hilltop"
